From 3e019d9739aa81c79feb9337441b32e2bdb7796b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varsha Maira <vmaira@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 31 May 2024 12:56:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-418] fs1: bootrom: add tpm support functions

This patch ports the TPM functions from gaudi3 to
FS1 as is but with minor FS1 specific changes to
common. Device specific register accesses are moved
to device specific folder. These functions will be
used to initialize and extend PCRs to TPM device.

Change-Id: Ic247ba278a961e71bcce338b6e49f9accb35a18b
Signed-off-by: Varsha Maira <vmaira@habana.ai>
---

